WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.737 --> 00:00:02.698
(eclectic music)

00:00:02.698 --> 00:00:04.472
- [Narrator] In the
northwest region of Cambodia,

00:00:04.472 --> 00:00:07.315
there's a sight like none
other, where trees rise

00:00:07.315 --> 00:00:11.796
from rooftops and roots snake
their way through walls.

00:00:11.796 --> 00:00:14.952
This is Ta Prohm, a
12th-century Buddhist temple

00:00:14.952 --> 00:00:17.694
that's become one with the jungle.

00:00:17.694 --> 00:00:21.861
(eclectic music)

